      "code": "// readonlyTransact: no BEGIN/COMMIT, any connection\npool.readonlyTransact(conn ->\n    conn.queryFirst(sql, codec)\n);\n\n// transact: BEGIN + query + COMMIT on reserved connection\npool.transact(conn ->\n    conn.execute(selectById.on(42))\n);",
